  "summary": "Finalizes the executed ordinary-text adoption plan without changing product code. The plan's Defaults became a Decision, Pick, Alternative and Word table, its after fences now quote the real call sites, and its delta folded into the new subject file docs/plans/topics/autocomplete.md with the current owners, a comparison of twelve external editors, and Open work with owners. On October 3, in the working checkout at HEAD fe0e9599a6, api-reference --check, check:docs, build:registry --check and the apps/www package-integration typecheck passed, and the registry install proof failed on DnD registry types in block-menu.tsx and dnd.tsx, which the DnD workstream owns. A probe of Plite's input stamp found that string data pasted, yanked, dropped or labeled a replacement and inserted at a collapsed caret passes the built owner's typing-check helper, and an Android keyboard-clipboard paste arrives as insertText, so hard law 5 has known violations, now tracked in the subject's Open work. The next iteration, docs/plans/2026-10-03-autocomplete-occurrence-host.md, is planning after an arena and two panel rounds.",
